window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>A lost world—a lost Eden—has been discovered.</b></p> <p>A corporation controls the portal that leads from Earth to the land of Lost Eden. They intend to exploit the incredible richness of that world.</p> <p>But there is a small team on the other side, fighting to survive against incredible odds. Nearly everything they meet tries to kill them. The members of that team have different ideas about what should happen with Lost Eden.</p> <p>But there is a seemingly ancient monk named Tokin who holds the secret to everything.</p> <p>With the portal to Earth seemingly closed, will the team be able to find a way home, or will they truly be stranded, marooned—exiled?</p> <p>Exiled <i>is the third and final book in the Lost Eden trilogy, narrated by Johnathan McClain. Contains a special note from the author.</i></p>"; 
